	<item>
		<title>Seed Shanty</title>
		<link>https://pbfcomics.com/comics/seed-shanty/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Nicholas Gurewitch]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 15:54:12 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://pbfcomics.com/?post_type=comics&#038;p=2727</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img src='https://pbfcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/PBF-Seed_Shanty.png' width='1300' height='1881' alt='Song birds sing a sea shanty aboard a schooner boat loaded to the deck with bags of seed: “Seed, Seed, Seed! All the seed we need!” Captain Robin Cornwallis has seen something through his spyglass which causes him grave concern, even as the singing continues (“On this we are agreed…”) Spyglass view: A pirate ship approaches. At every level of the ship, it is crawling with scurvy, rascally squirrels, each with their eyes aimed at the bird’s ship. “Seed, seed, seed!” the momentarily-oblivious crew of The Feeder continues.' title='PBF-Seed_Shanty' /></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://pbfcomics.com/comics/seed-shanty/">Seed Shanty</a> appeared first on <a href="https://pbfcomics.com">The Perry Bible Fellowship</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<img src='https://pbfcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/PBF-Seed_Shanty.png' width='1300' height='1881' alt='Song birds sing a sea shanty aboard a schooner boat loaded to the deck with bags of seed: “Seed, Seed, Seed! All the seed we need!” Captain Robin Cornwallis has seen something through his spyglass which causes him grave concern, even as the singing continues (“On this we are agreed…”) Spyglass view: A pirate ship approaches. At every level of the ship, it is crawling with scurvy, rascally squirrels, each with their eyes aimed at the bird’s ship. “Seed, seed, seed!” the momentarily-oblivious crew of The Feeder continues.' title='PBF-Seed_Shanty' /><p>The post <a href="https://pbfcomics.com/comics/seed-shanty/">Seed Shanty</a> appeared first on <a href="https://pbfcomics.com">The Perry Bible Fellowship</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
